From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 14:43:35 -0700
Subject: Fix bugs when worker terminates during MediaSource attachment

Store the CrossThreadMediaSourceAttachment in media_source_attachment_
when created in MediaSource::handle() so that ContextDestroyed()
always notifies the attachment under attachment_state_lock_, even if
worker termination races with StartAttachingToMediaElement() on the
main thread before attachment has completed.

Fixed: 569659190
Change-Id: I07bdd91cc99ac8a51cbf55eb400914dc201ec3f2
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8518402
Commit-Queue: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Eugene Zemtsov <eugene@chromium.org>
Auto-Submit: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1713898}

